                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2f113908-feea-314a-b38a-c18f9e2b16f8",
                        "entry_id": "4d5ad149-e165-35e8-90d6-86bff83fab95",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to caress, to fondle each other"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "72bcc7dd-0a6e-406d-b018-c7444ca034dd",
                                "sense_id": "2f113908-feea-314a-b38a-c18f9e2b16f8",
                                "text": "Са́ша гля́нул на неё ла́сковыми чёрными глаза́ми, — и они́ вдруг ста́ли вла́жными, — и тихо́нько сказа́л:\n— Я люблю́ ласка́ться.\n— Ишь ты, како́й не́жный, — сказа́ла Людми́ла и обняла́ его́ за пле́чи, — ласка́ться лю́бишь. А полоска́ться лю́бите?",
                                "translation": "Sasha looked at her with his soft, dark eyes—they suddenly became moist—and he said quietly :\n\" I like to caress.\"\n\" Well, you are a nice boy,\" said Liudmilla, putting her arm on his shoulder. \" So you like to caress ? But do you like to splash in your bath ? \"",
                                "english": "Sasha looked at her with his soft, dark eyes—they suddenly became moist—and he said quietly :\n\" I like to caress.\"\n\" Well, you are a nice boy,\" said Liudmilla, putting her arm on his shoulder. \" So you like to caress ? But do you like to splash in your bath ? \""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
